    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1071">

                <pb facs="1164" n="1152" sameAs="frus:frus1944v03/pg1152"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">865.01/9–2644: Circular telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Diplomatic Representatives in
                        the American Republics Except Argentina </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-09-26T17:00:00-04:00">September 26,
                            1944—5 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Please see the Foreign Minister at once and carry out instructions contained in
                    the Department’s secret circular of September 25, 5 p.m. A joint
                        statement<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1071-f1"/> is now being made public by
                    President Roosevelt and Prime Minister Churchill incorporating the information
                    contained in numbered paragraphs 1 and 2 of the circular of September 25. Please
                    explain to the Foreign Minister that this announcement was decided on as being
                    necessary for the successful prosecution of the war and, of course, does not
                    constitute establishment of diplomatic relations with the Italian
                    Government.</p>
                <p>This Government is awaiting with interest the views of the government to which
                    you are accredited concerning the question of full recognition of the Italian
                    Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
